.TH DANBY-VARYINGPENDULUM 1
.SH NAME
danby-varyingpendulum \- simulate a pendulum whose length varies
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B varyingpendulum
.SH DESCRIPTION
The suspension length changes sinusoidally.  The equation includes the radial
Coriolis term, so a drive near twice the natural frequency can parametrically
amplify the swing.  The diagram shows the changing length and the plot compares
angle with length.
.PP
Click a parameter scale to change it, space pauses, period steps while paused,
R resets, and Q exits.
